OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine across the region and
OL,7,Fthen dry overnight with prolonged
OL,8,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,9,FStaying warm in urban areas with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Funder strong sunshine. Feeling hot or
OL,14,Flocally very hot. As a result, an
OL,15,Famber extreme heat warning has been
OL,16,Fissued, and this covers part of London.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
